[
  {
    "id": "th_001",
    "text": "Some days the quiet is enough, and other days it is just the absence of an answer.",
    "category": "reflection",
    "mood": "reflective",
    "intensity": "medium",
    "format": "diary",
    "tags": [
      "solitude",
      "quiet"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "th_002",
    "text": "You grow up and suddenly the biggest problem is that nobody called you back.",
    "category": "thought",
    "mood": "humour",
    "intensity": "low",
    "format": "scrapbook",
    "tags": [
      "growingup",
      "friendship"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "th_003",
    "text": "The version of you that laughed at everything is still in there. She just takes longer to come out.",
    "category": "reflection",
    "mood": "melancholic",
    "intensity": "medium",
    "format": "diary",
    "tags": [
      "change",
      "growingup"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "th_004",
    "text": "I keep a list of things I did not say, mostly to prove that I was thinking about you.",
    "category": "relationship",
    "mood": "romantic",
    "intensity": "medium",
    "format": "letter",
    "tags": [
      "words",
      "silence"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "th_005",
    "text": "Rest is not the same as being tired, but it is harder to admit.",
    "category": "thought",
    "mood": "calm",
    "intensity": "low",
    "format": "minimal",
    "tags": [
      "rest",
      "slow"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "th_006",
    "text": "Nothing is as clarifying as a long walk with no destination and no headphones.",
    "category": "thought",
    "mood": "calm",
    "intensity": "low",
    "format": "diary",
    "tags": [
      "walking",
      "thinking"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "th_007",
    "text": "Everyone is one bad week away from a completely different life, and almost nobody tells you that.",
    "category": "observation",
    "mood": "reflective",
    "intensity": "high",
    "format": "editorial",
    "tags": [
      "perspective",
      "change"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "th_008",
    "text": "I like people who are late and honest about being late.",
    "category": "humour",
    "mood": "funny",
    "intensity": "low",
    "format": "scrapbook",
    "tags": [
      "friendship",
      "quirky"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "th_009",
    "text": "The trick is not to want the old days back. It is to let them be worth having had.",
    "category": "reflection",
    "mood": "nostalgic",
    "intensity": "medium",
    "format": "nostalgic",
    "tags": [
      "nostalgia",
      "growth"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "th_010",
    "text": "Some people arrive in your life like weather, and you are glad for the rain anyway.",
    "category": "observation",
    "mood": "reflective",
    "intensity": "medium",
    "format": "editorial",
    "tags": [
      "people",
      "weather"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "th_011",
    "text": "I am learning that being needed is not the same as being loved.",
    "category": "relationship",
    "mood": "melancholic",
    "intensity": "high",
    "format": "diary",
    "tags": [
      "love",
      "honesty"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "th_012",
    "text": "Your phone is full of photos of a person you barely speak to anymore.",
    "category": "observation",
    "mood": "nostalgic",
    "intensity": "low",
    "format": "scrapbook",
    "tags": [
      "memories",
